#9601
The Loch of the Dead~
   A dark river flows in from the west, forming a pool of numbingly cold water.
An eerie steam radiates from the pool, though the air around you chills you
beneath your clothing.  Out of the corner of your eye, the mist appears to take
on hideous, beastly forms which fade away before you can look at them directly.
A large mountain sits atop the fog to the east. Foul smelling swamp land lies
to the north.    
~
