#9602
The Veiled Passage~
You find solid footing, though you cannot see the path you take for the mist
engulfing you.  Muffled sounds escape from the trees to the south.  Glancing
in that direction, you notice the forest grows quite dark, and you feel as
though you are being watched from the shadows.  The mist appears to grow
thinner to the east.
~
