#9603
A Thin Mist~
The mist is much thinner here, forming into tiny columns that swirl around
your feet.  The forest is especially thick to the south, though one enourmous
tree seems to dominate the others.  The path continues to the east, but
appears to be blocked by a recent landslide.
~
