#9605
Entering Drekken Noir~
You approach Drekken Noir, the forest of eternal night.  An almost visible
breeze rustles the ebony leaves of the trees looming over you, carrying with
it the chill of death.  You sense a presence in the trees, moving when you
move, stopping when you stop.  Stories of this forest tell of cursed
inhabitants, doomed to remain here for time eternal.  Even through death,
they could not be freed.
~
