#9620
A Dark Path~
You follow a trail of overwhelming darkness.  If not for the brush on either
side, you would soon find yourself off the path and deep into the heart of
the forest, facing whatever horrors lurk there.  The leaves seem to hiss at
you as they rustle in the chill wind, and as you move along the trail, you
sense shadows in the trees stalking you.
